      "writtenOn": "2012-09-06T04:31:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Quick Qs:\n\nWhat is the difference between init1 \u0026 init2?\n\nDoes the EC use two physical i2c busses?\n\nIs the EC a master and a slave on both of them, or just the one connected to the AP?\n\nIf only the AP, then only that ones needs i2c_ claim/release, right?",
      "revId": "e54ac8da053cd525946d9c7410405fe1686c5400",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
