        "id": 1000107
      },
      "writtenOn": "2012-09-06T15:34:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Technically there are two busses.  We only use one on snow due to stuffing options.  The EC is a master and a slave on the same bus (#2).  The EC doesn\u0027t use bus #1.\n\nThe board_i2c_claim() knows which bus has arbitration and acts as a no-op in the other one.",
      "parentUuid": "AAAAPn//0NE\u003d",
      "revId": "e54ac8da053cd525946d9c7410405fe1686c5400",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
